      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You possess an item infused with draconic power, whether that be an item of significance gifted to you from a powerful dragon, a piece of treasure stolen from a mighty dragon's hoard, or even a discarded or forcefully removed piece of a dragon's body. This object allows you to call on a fragment of that dragon's essence to perform mighty magical deeds."
          }
        ]
